    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300aEntropy Architects\u300b</i> is a strategic roguelike game that utilizes a variety of set effects and legendary affixes to create unimaginable spell effects. With ultra-high freedom in builds, you can break through limits. Your operational decisions will influence the height of your tower climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combination of Sets and Legendary Affixes:</strong><br>The combination of legendary affixes with sets will produce magical chemical reactions. When you construct a unique effect, your skills will undergo a qualitative transformation.<br>How you make reasonable choices during the process will determine the height of your climb. The upper limit of your build will always depend on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics:</strong><br>Relics can generally be categorized into operational and combat power types, and the choice of relics is limited.<br>Therefore, how you manage your operations will be another layer of strategic decision-making, with a bit of luck involved. Among the limited relic choices, will you prioritize operations or immediate combat power?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-Specific Loot Pools:</strong><br>Each class will have its own loot pool, featuring 3 class-specific sets and 5 or more universal sets. These sets enhance your capabilities across three dimensions: survival, damage, and support.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300aEntropy Architects\u300b</i> is a strategic roguelike game that utilizes a variety of set effects and legendary affixes to create unimaginable spell effects. With ultra-high freedom in builds, you can break through limits. Your operational decisions will influence the height of your tower climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combination of Sets and Legendary Affixes:</strong><br>The combination of legendary affixes with sets will produce magical chemical reactions. When you construct a unique effect, your skills will undergo a qualitative transformation.<br>How you make reasonable choices during the process will determine the height of your climb. The upper limit of your build will always depend on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics:</strong><br>Relics can generally be categorized into operational and combat power types, and the choice of relics is limited.<br>Therefore, how you manage your operations will be another layer of strategic decision-making, with a bit of luck involved. Among the limited relic choices, will you prioritize operations or immediate combat power?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-Specific Loot Pools:</strong><br>Each class will have its own loot pool, featuring 3 class-specific sets and 5 or more universal sets. These sets enhance your capabilities across three dimensions: survival, damage, and support.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;With each layer's laws collapsing, every decision reforges the world!&quot; Will you become a desperate gambler, or emerge as a calculating tactician? Every choice remolds your fate \u2013 and sometimes, you'll need a dash of luck to tip the scales. Forge your ultimate build and conquer the impossible!",
